{"id":"vod_bf_10442","vodId":"10442","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"盖亚奥特曼","name_cn":"盖亚奥特曼","date":"1998-01-01","year":"1998","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-11/cd6f11d6d73a4c9e7bcc2bd2e88bafcd.jpg"},"summary":"1997年，超级电脑炼金之星预测到地球将会破坏招来体所消灭。得知此事后人类用炼金之星的研究技术组成一个全球防御组织GUARD，而XIG则是GUARD的战斗力量。　　2000年，天才少年·高山我梦在一次试验中见到神秘的红色光之巨人。当破坏招来体第一次进攻的时侯，XIG起不到作用。此时，我梦坠入光之隧道，并再次看见巨人，他希望巨人能赐予力量保卫地球。于是，巨人与我梦合二为一，并与破坏招来体展开了战斗。　　在战胜破坏招来体之后，我梦加入了XIG，而巨人则被命名为“盖亚”。但此时，另一名青年·藤宫博也亦拥有着变身成巨人“阿古茹”的力量。两个巨人与破坏招来体将会展开一连串的战斗。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-09 19:32:45","playable":true,"episodeCount":51,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/gaiyaaoteman/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/gaiyaaoteman/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/gaiyaaoteman/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/gaiyaaoteman/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/gaiyaaoteman/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/gaiyaaoteman/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/gaiyaaoteman/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/gaiyaaoteman/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/gaiyaaoteman/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/gaiyaaoteman/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/gaiyaaoteman/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/gaiyaaoteman/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/gaiyaaoteman/第13集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/gaiyaaoteman/第14集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"